msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:89
msgid "Add a service"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:91
msgid "Register services in a plugin or the theme. The groups are essential, preferences, statistics, marketing and external-media. The silvertrail_config filter edits or removes anything at the end."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:99
msgid "Change a service"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:101
msgid "Register a service again by its ID with only the fields to change. A preset’s ID turns the preset on with its defaults, so trackers need only their tag_id. The silvertrail_config filter runs last and can edit or remove any service."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:109
msgid "Gate a script"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:111
msgid "The browser ignores the tag until the visitor agrees to the service. Scripts enqueued with a handle listed under handles are gated without changes. Any link to #silvertrail opens the preferences."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:119
msgid "JavaScript"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:120
msgid "Read and react to choices in the browser."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:126
#: includes/Admin/tabs/banner.php:180
msgid "Texts"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:128
msgid "Put the JSON from the Banner tab into the theme as silvertrail/texts-{locale}.json, or as silvertrail/texts.json for every language. A child theme wins over its parent. The silvertrail_translation filter can return another path or an array. The admin’s edits win over the file, and the silvertrail_texts filter runs last."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:136
msgid "Design"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:138
msgid "The banner takes its colors, corners and buttons from the theme’s theme.json. The silvertrail_design filter changes any of them. Its keys are background, text, muted, line, accent, on-accent, radius, button-padding and button-weight, and each becomes a --silvertrail-<key> custom property. For anything else, the theme adds silvertrail/silvertrail.css, which loads last. styling.md in the plugin folder is the brief for an AI assistant that writes it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:146
msgid "Settings in code"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:148
msgid "The silvertrail_settings filter sets any setting on this page and more: layout, appearance, require_choice, imprint_page, records, floating_button (auto, always or never), load_css, expiry_months, retention_days, gpc and trail. A field set in code shows “Set in code” and cannot be changed here. wp silvertrail settings lists each value and where it comes from."
msgstr ""

